  "diffs": {
    "FINAL_THEOREM_CONTRACTS.md": "--- /root/autodl-tmp/symbolic_dynamics/docs/papers204_208_sequence/qa/central_round1_p210/FINAL_THEOREM_CONTRACTS.md\n+++ /root/autodl-tmp/symbolic_dynamics/docs/papers204_208_sequence/qa/p210_round1_central_update_check/inputs/FINAL_THEOREM_CONTRACTS.md\n@@ -3,9 +3,9 @@\n Date: 2026-09-07 UTC. A candidate is numbered only after its deductive and\n collision/source gate. Manuscript review can subsequently retire that\n contract without reusing the number. There are currently **five retained\n-papers, four completed papers and no unfilled seat**. P210's physical Round0\n-is complete and actual independent A is in progress; it is not accepted or\n-complete. P204 and P206 are\n+papers, four completed papers and no unfilled seat**. P210's accepted A and\n+physical Round1 are complete; actual independent B is in progress. P210 is\n+not complete. P204 and P206 are\n historically admitted, subsequently rejected numbered drafts.\n \n ## P204 — previous-smaller distance feedback — REJECTED IN REVIEW A\n@@ -364,7 +364,7 @@\n At P209 completion the census was four retained, four complete, one unfilled;\n P210 admission and its still-pending manuscript gates follow below.\n \n-## P210 — weakly increasing run aggregation — ROUND0 COMPLETE, A IN PROGRESS\n+## P210 — weakly increasing run aggregation — ROUND1 COMPLETE, B IN PROGRESS\n \n Proof contributors: root and `/root/twenty_seventh_finite_scout`. The\n manuscript/verifier author `/root/p210_author` and author-evidence helper\n@@ -422,7 +422,7 @@\n affected scope. OWNER_AMBER / HOLD_EXTERNAL remain.\n \n Paper path: `papers/210-weakly-increasing-run-aggregation/`.\n-Status: `P210_ROUND0_COMPLETE / MANUSCRIPT_A_IN_PROGRESS / NOT_COMPLETE`.\n+Status: `P210_ROUND1_COMPLETE / MANUSCRIPT_B_IN_PROGRESS / NOT_COMPLETE`.\n Root adopted the unchanged anonymous six-page author package and physically\n froze 493 payloads after actual original reception, strict author pair and\n all-six-page viewing. Root's two new runs each passed 197,471 checks on the\n@@ -432,10 +432,24 @@\n `e8446cd17b1a283c74f9a6b4ced413b9e30810396c3d30f936ac2986ce790e26`;\n its separate root closure passed all 1,022 paths, 57 links and six complete\n native manifest/raw checks. See [root physical milestone](qa/P210_ROUND0_ROOT_INSPECTION.md).\n-Fresh nonauthor `/root/p210_a_reviewer` is actually assigned; no A verdict or\n-accepted delta yet. Physical Round1/2, two actual accepted nonauthor rounds,\n-root A/B replays, terminal builds/views and final artifact/batch gate remain.\n+The same nonauthor `/root/p210_a_reviewer` actually accepted the exact\n+no-change response. Its final 552-payload package preserves all 484 initial\n+payloads, zero current open findings and one resolved Major. Root's strict\n+A pair each passed 133,978 checks on the original 4,095 states; the final\n+original/delta closure passed 621,735 checks and 119,932 current paths.\n+Old authenticated recorder/prehash and three old parent start times remain\n+unavailable, not retrospectively cleared. See [accepted A closure](qa/P210_A_ROOT_DELTA_INSPECTION.md).\n+Root physically froze Round1 with 508 payloads/509 files, seal\n+`be54b79806d90f22037cee877f92074e744b2ef27bcc0b6b2e4f8dfa658446e0`.\n+All 493 core and 489 author bytes are unchanged. Its separate root reception\n+passed 29,273 checks/2,164 paths and 507 full physical-copy comparisons;\n+see [Round1 closure](qa/P210_ROUND1_ROOT_INSPECTION.md).\n+Fresh distinct nonauthor `/root/p210_b_reviewer` has actually started from\n+the pinned 509 files under the materially different representation/proof\n+requirement. No B verdict or accepted B delta exists yet. B/root replay,\n+accepted delta, physical Round2, terminal builds/views and full artifact/\n+batch gates remain.\n Current census is five retained, four complete, no unfilled seat; the requested\n five-paper batch has NOT completed. Previous index bytes are\n-[physically preserved](qa/central_round0_p210/README.md); P204–P209's\n+[physically preserved](qa/central_round1_p210/README.md); P204–P209's\n scientific contracts and accepted evidence were not changed.\n",
    "GIT_SYNC_RECEIPT.md": "--- /root/autodl-tmp/symbolic_dynamics/docs/papers204_208_sequence/qa/central_round1_p210/GIT_SYNC_RECEIPT.md\n+++ /root/autodl-tmp/symbolic_dynamics/docs/papers204_208_sequence/qa/p210_round1_central_update_check/inputs/GIT_SYNC_RECEIPT.md\n@@ -3,7 +3,38 @@\n This is a work-in-progress backup, not five-paper completion or admission.\n All research remains `HOLD_EXTERNAL`.\n \n-## New local milestone after that ref — not yet synchronized\n+## Current local milestone and actual rejected checkpoint\n+\n+P210's accepted A and physical Round1 are now complete, and a fresh distinct\n+nonauthor B is actually in progress. Root's [Round1 reception](qa/P210_ROUND1_ROOT_INSPECTION.md),\n+the [four-build original reception](qa/BATCH_FOUR_BUILDS_ROOT_INSPECTION.md)\n+and [P208/P209 full-key reuse reception](qa/P208_P209_REUSE_ROOT_INSPECTION.md)\n+are current local evidence. No five-paper terminal PASS is asserted.\n+\n+The captured earlier Round0 scope was actually committed locally as\n+`1f028072dc408a7d4404a7276f22f8666ba81801`, tree\n+`a26e19ee04c7a25fd0b0d00c67df784206baba4c`, parent a380d247. Its full\n+objects were checked, but the actual normal push exited 1: GitHub GH001\n+rejected a 541.67 MB lossless raw archive inside the prior P209 private\n+execution package. This was a remote size rejection, not a timeout. The\n+local commit, stage/identity/push failures and all original bytes remain.\n+The actual failure is [recorded separately](qa/P210_CHECKPOINT_PUSH_REVISION02_ROOT_COMPLETION.actual.json).\n+There has been no new successful push; the latest confirmed remote remains\n+`a380d24718fec4ef27365f44e96fb7ffa2b0fd10`.\n+\n+The [separate correction preparation](qa/p210_checkpoint_remote_size_revision_01/README.md)\n+selects 2,013 paths from the immutable first-overlay capture, not the moving\n+current workspace: 2,012 retained paths plus one exact exclusion disclosure.\n+It excludes the entire old P209 private execution package, 306 files and\n+1,169,593,078 bytes, from this new checkpoint only. All excluded files remain\n+local; historical references and the rejected commit are unchanged. No LFS,\n+split raw archive, new storage service, deletion, history rewrite or force\n+push is authorized. The proposed fresh bare mirror has not yet been executed\n+or accepted. These new Round1/index/reception bytes are outside its captured\n+scope and are not silently included. The exact previous four controls are\n+[physically preserved](qa/central_round1_p210/README.md).\n+\n+## Previous local milestone — historical Round0 scope\n \n P210's unchanged anonymous six-page author package and 493-payload physical\n Round0 are now complete, with fresh nonauthor A actually assigned. Root's\n",
    "P210_ROOT_LIFECYCLE.md": "--- /root/autodl-tmp/symbolic_dynamics/papers/210-weakly-increasing-run-aggregation/frozen_round1/ROUND1_ACCEPTANCE/PRE_ROUND1_ROOT_LIFECYCLE.md\n+++ /root/autodl-tmp/symbolic_dynamics/docs/papers204_208_sequence/qa/p210_round1_central_update_check/inputs/P210_ROOT_LIFECYCLE.md\n@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@\n # P210 current root lifecycle\n \n-2026-09-07 UTC. **ROUND0_COMPLETE / MANUSCRIPT_A_IN_PROGRESS / NOT_COMPLETE /\n+2026-09-07 UTC. **ROUND1_COMPLETE_AFTER_ACCEPTED_A / MANUSCRIPT_B_IN_PROGRESS / NOT_COMPLETE /\n OWNER_AMBER / HOLD_EXTERNAL**.\n \n The unchanged author handoff is adopted and all 489 payloads are physically\n@@ -9,10 +9,21 @@\n record the actual original reception, strict author pair, six root draft\n views, physical copying, exact-origin links and separate native closure.\n \n-`/root/p210_a_reviewer` is the actual fresh nonauthor Review A process. No A\n-report/delta acceptance or B exists yet. The author README, frozen adoption\n+The same nonauthor `/root/p210_a_reviewer` actually accepted the exact\n+no-change response. Its final552-payload review and complete root closure\n+retain zero open findings and one resolved Major, with the old recorder and\n+three start-time losses still explicit. Root then physically froze508\n+payloads as Round1 and separately verified all core/acceptance copies,\n+input keys, link origins and complete manifests. See the\n+[accepted A and physical Round1](../../docs/papers204_208_sequence/qa/P210_ROUND1_ROOT_INSPECTION.md).\n+\n+Fresh distinct nonauthor `/root/p210_b_reviewer` has actually been assigned\n+Review B from Round1 seal\n+`be54b79806d90f22037cee877f92074e744b2ef27bcc0b6b2e4f8dfa658446e0`,\n+with a materially different representation/proof-route obligation. No B\n+verdict or accepted delta exists yet. The author README, frozen adoption\n and candidate artifacts retain their historical pending language; this\n-separate lifecycle supplies current status without rewriting those originals.\n+separate lifecycle supplies current status without rewriting originals.\n \n Root and the original scout are proof contributors; the manuscript/verifier\n writer and its author-evidence helper also cannot independently review P210.\n@@ -20,6 +31,8 @@\n \n The immutable `SHA256SUMS` and `AUTHOR_MANIFEST.sha256` are author-time scopes,\n not rolling whole-paper seals. Root's `PAPER_MANIFEST.sha256` separately covers\n-the current physical paper tree except itself. Physical Round0 is immutable.\n-Accepted A/B deltas must precede Round1/2; terminal builds/views, full artifact\n+the current physical paper tree except itself. Physical Round0/1 are immutable.\n+The old987-entry whole seal and exact prior lifecycle are physically retained\n+under frozen_round1/ROUND1_ACCEPTANCE/PRE_ROUND1_* with their original roles.\n+The accepted B delta must precede Round2; terminal builds/views, full artifact\n closure and the complete five-paper gate remain. No public release is allowed.\n",
    "PIPELINE_STATE.md": "--- /root/autodl-tmp/symbolic_dynamics/docs/papers204_208_sequence/qa/central_round1_p210/PIPELINE_STATE.md\n+++ /root/autodl-tmp/symbolic_dynamics/docs/papers204_208_sequence/qa/p210_round1_central_update_check/inputs/PIPELINE_STATE.md\n@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@\n # Batch after P203 — recovery state\n \n Started 2026-09-05 UTC on the user's “确认，下一轮”, reaffirmed by “继续”.\n-Status: **P205_P207_P208_P209_COMPLETE / P210_ROUND0_COMPLETE_MANUSCRIPT_A_IN_PROGRESS / FIVE_RETAINED_FOUR_COMPLETE / HOLD_EXTERNAL**.\n+Status: **P205_P207_P208_P209_COMPLETE / P210_ROUND1_COMPLETE_MANUSCRIPT_B_IN_PROGRESS / FIVE_RETAINED_FOUR_COMPLETE / HOLD_EXTERNAL**.\n The folder name reserves a five-seat working label, not five accepted paper IDs.\n \n ## Scope and next obligation\n@@ -32,9 +32,11 @@\n original reception plus actual strict independent-code pair. It is admitted\n as P210 under the exact two-axis ceiling in [root's decision](P210_ROOT_ADMISSION.md).\n Five papers are retained, four complete and no seat unfilled. P210's anonymous\n-six-page author package and physical Round0 are now complete; its actual\n-fresh nonauthor manuscript A is in progress. It still requires the accepted\n-manuscript rounds and terminal gates; five retained is not\n+six-page author package and physical Round0 are complete. Its same nonauthor\n+A has now actually accepted the exact no-change response, root has closed\n+its originals/delta, and physical Round1 is complete. A fresh distinct\n+nonauthor manuscript B is actually assigned. It still requires accepted B,\n+Round2 and terminal gates; five retained is not\n five completed. No further scout lane or another batch is authorized here.\n P205 manuscript A's exact no-change delta is accepted and Round1 is frozen;\n its B actual no-change delta is now accepted with zero findings. Round2,\n@@ -80,7 +82,53 @@\n [actual Round1/root physical closure](qa/P209_ROUND1_ROOT_INSPECTION.md).\n The requested five-paper batch is not complete.\n \n-Latest milestone (2026-09-07 UTC): **P210 physical Round0 complete; actual A assigned**.\n+Latest milestone (2026-09-07 UTC): **P210 accepted A and physical Round1 complete; actual B assigned**.\n+\n+The same `/root/p210_a_reviewer` actually accepted the exact unchanged\n+response. Root's final closure passed621,735 checks/119,932 actual reread\n+paths, preserving all484 initial payloads in the final552-payload review,\n+with zero current open findings and one resolved Major. The old authenticated\n+recorder/prehash and three old parent start times remain unavailable; no\n+failure or source limit was erased. See [accepted A/root closure](qa/P210_A_ROOT_DELTA_INSPECTION.md).\n+Root's previously completed strict A pair each passed133,978 checks on the\n+same4,095 states and3,634 known inputs with full raw-canonical equality.\n+\n+Root actually created508-payload/509-file Round1, seal\n+`be54b79806d90f22037cee877f92074e744b2ef27bcc0b6b2e4f8dfa658446e0`.\n+All493 core/all489 author bytes are unchanged;13 physical anchors retain\n+accepted A and exact prior lifecycle/whole-manifest roles. The separate\n+root physical reception passed29,273 checks/2,164 current paths,507 full\n+copy comparisons,57+14 links,33 original external roles and six native\n+checks. See [physical Round1/root acceptance](qa/P210_ROUND1_ROOT_INSPECTION.md).\n+Fresh distinct `/root/p210_b_reviewer` has actually been assigned from the\n+pinned509 inputs with a materially different representation/proof-route\n+requirement and a pre-author-code commitment. No B verdict or accepted delta\n+exists yet. Root, proof contributors and author/helper processes cannot\n+review P210. B/delta/Round2, terminal builds/views, complete paper artifact\n+closure and the first five-paper gate remain; no42nd scout or new batch.\n+\n+The P205/P207 four fresh terminal builds and ten root views now have\n+[complete original root reception](qa/BATCH_FOUR_BUILDS_ROOT_INSPECTION.md).\n+P208/P209's current full-key reuse also actually passed3,988,646 checks/\n+136,582 paths, with six pairs/four builds/eleven prior views explicitly\n+REUSED, not newly executed. Its separate root wrapper-original reception\n+passed72,588 checks/3,340 paths, including all3,276 parent keys and all34\n+failed-attempt pins. See [root reuse acceptance](qa/P208_P209_REUSE_ROOT_INSPECTION.md).\n+All prior scientific contracts remain unchanged. The full five-paper\n+terminal adapter is being prepared, not executed or accepted.\n+\n+Private checkpoint1f028072 exists locally with exact validated tree/objects\n+but was rejected by the remote for an oversized prior Git-execution archive.\n+The original failed stage, identity failure, rejection, retained local\n+commit and all large logs remain. A separately scoped correction uses the\n+immutable captured overlay, excluding the entire306-file prior P209 private\n+execution package from this checkpoint only; that package remains local.\n+No successful new push is asserted; last confirmed remote remainsa380d247.\n+The [four pre-update controls](qa/central_round1_p210/README.md) are physical.\n+\n+Previous milestone: **P210 physical Round0 complete; actual A assigned**.\n+The following paragraph preserves its former pending scope; accepted A,\n+physical Round1 and current B assignment above control the next obligation.\n Root adopted the unchanged 489-payload anonymous author handoff, retaining\n exactly the triangular clock and image-threshold/bijection ceiling below.\n Root's actual strict author pair passed two 197,471-check runs on the unchanged\n",
    "SYMBOLIC_DYNAMICS_STATE.md": "--- /root/autodl-tmp/symbolic_dynamics/docs/papers204_208_sequence/qa/central_round1_p210/SYMBOLIC_DYNAMICS_STATE.md\n+++ /root/autodl-tmp/symbolic_dynamics/docs/papers204_208_sequence/qa/p210_round1_central_update_check/inputs/SYMBOLIC_DYNAMICS_STATE.md\n@@ -4,9 +4,10 @@\n \n ## 当前结论\n \n-- P210 已完成[匿名六页稿及物理 Round0](docs/papers204_208_sequence/qa/P210_ROUND0_ROOT_INSPECTION.md)，新的非作者进程 `/root/p210_a_reviewer` 已实际开始稿审 A，尚无 A 裁决或接受 delta。root 严格作者双重放各197,471检查、原盒4,095状态N=1..12及3,639输入闭合；完整作者原件复核通过856,758检查/118,295当前路径。六页已实际视读，493项Round0封印及1,022路径/57链接/六条完整native复核通过。仅保留原准入的尖锐三角质量时钟和完整像集阈值/显式双射；旧coarsening/ancestry、partition transfer、run-network、三角数组合及reset编码仍扣除。root、原scout、稿件作者及作者证据助手均不能独立自审。所有来源/locale/gconv失败保留；没有启动第42线或另一批。\n-- 当前执行批次：[P204 起的新五席研究](docs/papers204_208_sequence/PIPELINE_STATE.md)，状态 `P205_P207_P208_P209_COMPLETE / P210_ROUND0_COMPLETE_MANUSCRIPT_A_IN_PROGRESS / FIVE_RETAINED_FOUR_COMPLETE`。现有四篇内部完成：P205、P207、P208、P209；P210尚未完成，P204、P206 的稿审 A 淘汰及全部原件保留。P209 的独立 A/B 接受、严格重放、物理三轮冻结、终端双构建及四页实际视读均已闭合，初始制品与生命周期复核现也实际通过。[最终 root 接受](docs/papers204_208_sequence/qa/P209_LIFECYCLE_ROOT_INSPECTION.md) 检查 132,389 个实际读取路径；最终 62 项制品保留原 46 项及所有失败。仅 ROOT_LIFECYCLE 及整篇清单对应一行改变，未增加 sharp 入口时钟等主张。当前保留5、完成4、空缺0；仍须完成P210两轮稿审/接受delta及终端流程和整批验收，不能把五席准入当五篇完成。\n-- 整批终端准备已补齐P205/P207旧回执缺少的运行复用键：[六组新root严格作者/A/B双重放](docs/papers204_208_sequence/qa/BATCH_STRICT_PAIRS_ROOT_INSPECTION.md)全通过，原盒/证明/接受稿不变。四次新源文件冷构建通过，PDF与接受版本逐字节一致，十页已重新实际视读；完整构建原件接收及P208/P209当前全键复用检查仍在准备，不能据此标整批PASS。[更新前四控制原件](docs/papers204_208_sequence/qa/central_round0_p210/README.md)已物理保留。\n+- P210 已完成[接受 A 及物理 Round1](docs/papers204_208_sequence/qa/P210_ROUND1_ROOT_INSPECTION.md)，新的不同非作者进程 `/root/p210_b_reviewer` 已实际开始稿审 B。A 接受精确无修改回应，最终552项材料保留全部484初始payload，当前零open、一项已解决Major及旧记录缺失仍明确。root严格A双重放各133,978检查；最终delta原件闭合621,735检查/119,932路径。Round1含508payload/509文件，493核心及489作者字节不变；独立物理核查通过29,273检查/2,164路径、507完整副本比较及六条native命令。尚无B裁决/接受delta。仅保留尖锐三角质量时钟及完整像集阈值/显式双射；全部旧机制扣除和来源/locale/gconv失败保留。作者/证明贡献者不能自审；没有第42线或另一批。\n+- 当前执行批次：[P204 起的新五席研究](docs/papers204_208_sequence/PIPELINE_STATE.md)，状态 `P205_P207_P208_P209_COMPLETE / P210_ROUND1_COMPLETE_MANUSCRIPT_B_IN_PROGRESS / FIVE_RETAINED_FOUR_COMPLETE`。现有四篇内部完成：P205、P207、P208、P209；P210尚未完成，P204、P206 的稿审 A 淘汰及全部原件保留。P209 的独立 A/B 接受、严格重放、物理三轮冻结、终端双构建及四页实际视读均已闭合，初始制品与生命周期复核现也实际通过。[最终 root 接受](docs/papers204_208_sequence/qa/P209_LIFECYCLE_ROOT_INSPECTION.md) 检查 132,389 个实际读取路径；最终 62 项制品保留原 46 项及所有失败。仅 ROOT_LIFECYCLE 及整篇清单对应一行改变，未增加 sharp 入口时钟等主张。当前保留5、完成4、空缺0；仍须完成P210的B审查/接受delta、Round2及终端流程和整批验收，不能把五席准入当五篇完成。\n+- 整批终端准备已补齐P205/P207旧运行键缺口：[六组新root严格作者/A/B双重放](docs/papers204_208_sequence/qa/BATCH_STRICT_PAIRS_ROOT_INSPECTION.md)全通过；[四次源文件冷构建及原件接收](docs/papers204_208_sequence/qa/BATCH_FOUR_BUILDS_ROOT_INSPECTION.md)已闭合，PDF与接受版逐字节一致、十页实际视读。P208/P209[全键复用及原件接收](docs/papers204_208_sequence/qa/P208_P209_REUSE_ROOT_INSPECTION.md)也实际通过：原子检查3,988,646/136,582路径，root另核72,588/3,340路径。明确复用六组旧双运行、四次旧构建、十一页旧实际视读，不是新科学或视读。整批终验器仍在准备，未标五篇PASS。[本次更新前四控制原件](docs/papers204_208_sequence/qa/central_round1_p210/README.md)已物理保留。\n+- 新本地检查点 `1f028072` 已提交并核完对象，但远端因约542MB历史Git执行压缩日志超限而拒绝；没有新成功推送。原提交、完整日志及stage/identity/push失败全部保留。纠正方案从不变的overlay副本同步2,013个限定路径，明确排除旧P209私有执行包306文件/1,169,593,078字节（仍完整保留本地），不读现行移动论文/索引；新bare镜像尚未执行/接受。此前确认远端仍为a380d247，见[当前私有同步边界](docs/papers204_208_sequence/GIT_SYNC_RECEIPT.md)。\n - 候选历史边界（本段保留旧阶段语境，当前末席结论以下方 MNA 条目为准）：LNR 原 HOLD_SOURCE 不变，直接相关 lower-rank 收敛旧文正文仍未核；数学重放不消除来源 finding。UGR 已按单一 rank-family 窄合同准入 P207，全局时钟仅为非 sharp、明确依赖有限证书的上界。MNC 的实际非作者 gate 已判 `MATH_VALID / KILL_VALUE_TEMPORAL_BINARY_WRAPPER`；root 读完整 adapter、通过 29/17/3 pins，并双次各重放 293,461 断言和原始字节比较后接受淘汰，MNC-V1 Critical/open 保留。其正确全目标逆像极值不能补足被扣除的时间轴，未编号。第六至第九线均已在原件与完整封印检查后关闭，无新增准入。CPRM 初等结果不送准入，CSGD carrier 失败保留；HVD/NCC 的局部证明不能代替缺失全局定理，CPC 原盒长周期亦不填席。第十线已通过 root 原件及 79/19、40/18+1+20 pins 核验：五条关闭 NO_PROMOTION，新非贡献者 `ofs_candidate_gate` 已实际给出 GO_NARROW_TWO_AXIS，旧 edge-labelled lift 与静态计数等全部扣除；root 读完整几何/逆像/K 时钟证明、来源边界及 452 行代码，双次各 628,980 检查和原始字节比较通过，87 条 gate 清单和 149 referents 前后不变，正式准入 P208；第十一线已通过 root 完整原件及 32/7 pins 核验，两个实际规则关闭 NO_PROMOTION。第十二线三条实测已通过 root 完整原件、22/12 pins 和实际 raw pair 比较后关闭 NO_PROMOTION；第十三线也已读完整证明/来源/代码，核完 55 条外封印、八份共 99 条清单、21 历史 pins 和 86 回执引用，并实际比较两类 raw pair 后关闭。其全参数 DAG 逆像极值不补足未证时间轴。第十四线也已完整原件/代码检查，39/11 pins、48 回执引用和两次 raw pair 比较通过后关闭；两个逆像极值证明不补足时间轴。第十五线亦已完整原件核查，六份 65 条清单、18 历史 pins、60/10 输入输出引用及两次 raw 比较通过后关闭；任意长周期的特定层构造不等于完整时间分类。第十六线完整原件/代码和 151 外封印、11/16 历史 pins、四次实际 raw 比较均核完后关闭 NO_PROMOTION；其局部尖锐定理不填席。第十七线完整案头原件及 6/10 pins 核完后关闭 NO_FRESH_SLATE，零新科学执行。第十八线完整原件及 7/13 pins 核完后也关闭 NO_FRESH_SLATE，零科学执行。第十九线已获不同新范围的有界侦察分配。\n - 最新确认私有推送为 `a380d24718fec4ef27365f44e96fb7ffa2b0fd10`：1,482个显式变化（1,476新增、6修改），19份清单/12,474行及12,555个暂存/提交Git对象键全部匹配；root另行完成原件/无损对象流检查和六条实际Git查询，确认远端相同、0/0且镜像干净。[root同步接受](docs/papers204_208_sequence/qa/P209_CHECKPOINT_ROOT_INSPECTION.md) 链接305项完整执行证据。该ref保留P209完成、选定第37–41线及MNA候选原件；不含后来的MNA root闭合/P210、执行接收回执或当前索引。旧四个控制原件已[物理保留](docs/papers204_208_sequence/qa/central_admission_p210/README.md)，无失败删除或历史重写。\n - 前次私有推送 `4bc38b63` 保留P209制品修订01–02/真实失败01–03、root闭合的第33–36线及六份补充材料；原[同步记录](docs/papers204_208_sequence/qa/GIT_OBJECT_P209_ARTIFACT_CORRECTIONS_4BC38B63.json) 保持不变。任何回执/索引都不倒填进自身所指的历史提交。\n"
